# Review model pin

When reviewing battle-test answers, skill quality, PRs, or agent understanding of the Building Codes Challenge:

- Use **Claude Opus 5.5** at the **highest available** tier (`claude-opus-5-5-max`, else `xhigh`, else `high`).
- Record the reviewer model slug in the review artifact.
- Do not accept a pass verdict from a non-Opus reviewer for env battle tests.
